{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2d8e9940b76eec9aebb275831dbbd824638a2637b74de6307302ba3c0910872", "ja": "（その後、例の番組で、765プロへの密着取材を\n元にしたアイドルドキュメンタリーが放送された）", "zh": "（之后，以对765制作人的跟踪采访为基础制作的偶像纪录片，在那档节目中播出了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d9fb164006d2850e1b6c29ff33afa886337d74d3802bf14ac263f4dcbbf077a6", "ja": "（放送後の反響はかなり大きかった。\nお互いこれをどう活かすか、今後の課題だな……）", "zh": "（节目播出后的反响相当大。接下来要怎么把这件事化为助力，也是我们今后的课题啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "924c265dc0ab517ea443cb3fbd127bd0f3261167c2ede58e243d23f9fde08fa4", "ja": "ん～～、やっぱ映り方がこの前と全然違う！\nドキュメンタリーだからかなぁ？", "zh": "嗯～～果然，镜头里的感觉和之前完全不一样！是因为是纪录片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "701aa9a43055a898afcc53ea2d9ca5a62e8c0adf656d20b0f7b797280e1c144e", "ja": "密着取材、ずっとカメラが入ってたもんね。\nあんなに長く追いかけられたの、初めてかも。", "zh": "贴身跟拍时，摄像机一直都在拍呢。\n被跟拍那么长时间，可能还是头一回。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "fca767812b2762ffe8f3aa32199ecb22ea04bed756b8db02c07e061fa39804d0", "ja": "私も我那覇さんも、密着は何度か経験してますけど。\nでも、バラエティ番組は初めてかと。", "zh": "我和我那霸女士都经历过几次跟拍采访。不过，综艺节目还是第一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "3a213c1897df9994ed0c2cf1f8d7db5c8ede30442b4c6e6f1861fa23182d19da", "ja": "普通はやらないもんね！\nでも自分は、すっごく面白かったと思うぞ！", "zh": "一般来说确实不会这么做呢！\n不过我觉得，这次真的超级有趣哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "e631aa0c79a517c44593b4d6c3ec5b954e54f35e31f3bbb2be8308125e10df3c", "ja": "前回の番組収録のこと、自分たちが\nどう感じたかも話せたし……なんかスッキリした！", "zh": "还能聊聊自己对上次录制节目的感受……感觉痛快多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f49fbf4f6cfe74fe4066791c381913f650b16bd226eff488a9efec29b8642587", "ja": "それなら良かった。", "zh": "那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "b918bc2aea3fbfcc0e8c4f7f768f59bfdbb3179daaf1e8f0b12c74b649f8bb86", "ja": "それにしても{$P$}、\nよくOKしたね？　あんな撮影の後だったのに。", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}，\n你居然答应了啊？明明才拍完那种节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5f1c1997e80ca1e50cc2d0dc353b054342f8702947495bee7a91e5b304cbf63c", "ja": "そうだな……番組というのは本来、\n人を楽しませる目的で作っているはずだろ？", "zh": "是啊……节目本来就是为了给人们带来快乐而制作的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e1cb825c025db7e0796cc8b247d5ce026c26daa48f27d71ea6184b875f96121f", "ja": "新しいディレクターさんの思うそれを、\n個人的に信じたかった……というところかな。", "zh": "我想在个人层面上，去相信新导演心目中的这份心意吧……大概是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_143_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6a41b4e9803aee3d0ddbff033ec85efa79ef9e4c5c45c97609ebec23c6b5b851", "ja": "みんなにも、それからTVを見ている人達にも、\nバラエティを嫌なものだと思ってほしくないと思って。", "zh": "我不希望大家，还有那些正在看电视的人们，觉得综艺节目是件讨厌的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
